From 2942459ab515213d3ca8fd8a2b7df5240ff599fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:17:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(games): platform/studio filters, list view and Most
 active sort (GFE-SORT)

Designed through the Design System Agent harness (brief -> scope -> flow ->
design -> audit); records live in hernandez-afk/FeedbackAgentTest.

Backend (additive):
- GET /api/games: repeatable platform/studio filters (before pagination),
  sort=activity (sessions in the last 30 days), studio_name + created_at.
- GET /api/games/facets: scoped platform/studio options with counts.
- GET /api/sessions: repeatable platform filter.

Frontend:
- /games filter panel (left column from lg:, collapsible on phones),
  removable filter chips, Cards/List view switch, Most active sort.
- Shared meta line (platform, studio, date added) on card and list row.
- /sessions Platform dropdown; Clear link uses --color-accent-text.

