After the brief author's answers and Andreas Beijer's design:
- Catalogue groupings: project (intended use) and title (franchise) tables,
  set by name on the add/edit game forms (get-or-create, case-insensitive).
- Platforms group and filter case-insensitively (MSN = msn).
- Stars: per-user favourites (PUT/DELETE /api/games/{id}/favorite) and a
  Starred sort.
- Critical warning: latest sentiment report >= 40% negative over >= 5
  reviews (reviewers only) and a Critical sort.
- GET /api/games/navigation feeds a Project -> Platform -> Title -> game
  sidebar tree on /games and on the game dashboard; a drawer on phones.
- Versions of one title collapse into a single card/row on /games.
- Audit round 1 fixes: 44px list-row actions, 4px spacing, visible
  Sort/View labels, perceptible hover, shared pill for chips, 12-column
  layout, data-driven filter groups, sessions platform counts say games.

