+"""GFE-SORT project, franchise (title) and game_favorite
+
+Adds the catalogue groupings the /games sidebar is built on:
+  * ``project``   - what a game is for ("Andreas Sketches"); game.project_id
+  * ``franchise`` - the TITLE games are versions of ("Asteroids"); UI "Title";
+                    game.franchise_id
+  * ``game_favorite`` - per-user starred games
+
+All additive and nullable: every existing game has no project and no title and
+renders exactly as before (its own title card, the "No project" group).
